Any unauthorized commercial implementation, deployment, staging, reverse engineering, decomposition of cryptographic routines, hardware abstraction layer (HAL) interception, or incorporation into open-source or commercial products without a prior written license agreement executed by the Author is strictly prohibited and constitutes:

* **Direct patent infringement** under the Industrial Property Law (*Ustawa z dnia 30 czerwca 2000 r. – Prawo własności przemysłowej*, Dz.U. 2001 nr 49 poz. 508 with subsequent amendments);
* **Breach of business secrets and unfair competition** under the Act on Combating Unfair Competition (*Ustawa o zwalczaniu nieuczciwej konkurencji*) and Directive (EU) 2016/943;
* **Willful copyright infringement** under the Act on Copyright and Related Rights (*Ustawa o prawie autorskim i prawach pokrewnych*).

The Author reserves the right to seek preliminary injunctions, seize infringing hardware and software deployments, and demand full accounting of profits alongside statutory punitive damages.

